      "updated": 1787102311748,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "路由解析 — dispatcher.uc 的原始规则\n  alias / firstchild / node_weight / wildcard\n\n沿分派路径折叠 ACL\n  -> nodespec.readonly -> Save & Apply 状态\n\nL.env, body[data-page], document.title\n页面级补丁 CSS/JS 和节点 css 状态\n\n菜单高亮、面包屑、#tabmenu\n  只更新状态 — 不重建菜单\n\n清理\n  Poll 队列 · uci 缓存 · 定时器\n  每次渲染的监听器 · 模态框 ........ +1 ubus 调用",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "路由解析 — dispatcher.uc 的原始规则\n  alias / firstchild / node_weight / wildcard\n\n沿分派路径折叠 ACL\n  -> nodespec.readonly -> Save & Apply 状态\n\nL.env, body[data-page], document.title\n页面级补丁 CSS/JS 和节点 css 状态\n\n菜单高亮、面包屑、#tabmenu\n  只更新状态 — 不重建菜单\n\n清理\n  Poll 队列 · uci 缓存 · 定时器\n  每次渲染的监听器 · 模态框 ........ +1 ubus 调用",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "syncedAt": "2026-08-19T01:19:03.071Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
